'''''Musschia aurea''''', is a species of flowering plant in the [[Campanulaceae]] [[Family (taxonomy)|family]].<ref name="POWO"/> It is [[endemic]] to the [[Madeira Islands]], including [[Madeira Island|Madeira]] and the [[Desertas Islands|Desertas]]. It grows on sea cliffs and rocky offshore islets.<ref name=iucn/> 

